# Keep Cursor / agent indexing off regenerated and vendor trees.
# Product source of truth stays under src/, lib/, app/, docs/, and AGENTS.md.

**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/coverage/
**/.turbo/
**/.cache/
**/.dart_tool/
**/ios/Pods/
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/app/build/
**/release/
**/win-unpacked/
**/*.apk
**/*.aab
**/*.log

# Lockfiles are huge; open only when changing dependencies.
**/package-lock.json
**/pnpm-lock.yaml
**/yarn.lock
**/pubspec.lock

# Probe / fixture dumps
scripts/commander-downloads/
**/*.map

# Secrets and local env (examples stay visible via git)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/secrets/**
!**/.gitkeep
**/*service-account*.json
**/store-desk-*.json
